        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francine McDougall, Whitney Sloan, Everlife, Marley Shelton, Marla Sokoloff, Mena Suvari, James Marsden, Melissa George\n- Products: Go Figure, Cow Belles, Sugar & Spice, Go Figure soundtrack\n- Companies: Disney Channel, Walt Disney Records\n\nFacts:\n- Francine McDougall directed the 2001 American teen crime comedy film \"Sugar & Spice.\"\n- \"Sugar & Spice\" starred Marley Shelton, Marla Sokoloff, Mena Suvari, James Marsden, and Melissa George.\n- \"Go Figure\" is a 2005 Disney Channel Original Movie.\n- Francine McDougall directed the Disney Channel Original Movie \"Go Figure\" in 2005.\n- Walt Disney Records released the \"Go Figure\" soundtrack on June 7, and it featured the title track by Everlife along with a music video.\n- Francine McDougall directed the Disney Channel Original Movie \"Cow Belles\" in 2006.\n- Whitney Adela Sloan, born on 21 August 1988 in London, is a British-born actress best known for playing Hollywood Henderson in \"Go Figure.\"",
